      "association_text": "Klebsiella aerogenes expands in the oral cavity during periodontitis, translocates to the gut, and triggers colitis via NLRP3/caspase-11 inflammasome activation and IL-1β production by intestinal macrophages in multiple mouse models (DSS colitis in SPF mice; germ-free Il10−/− and Rag1−/− gnotobiotic colonization models).",
