    {
      "association_text": "K. aerogenes is the most abundant species in the synthetic ligature-associated oral microbiome (sLOM) that drives colitis in germ-free Il10−/− and Rag1−/− mice; sLOM-colonized mice show significantly elevated fecal Lcn2, worsened colonic histological scores, and increased colonic Th17/Th1 T cells compared to sHOM controls (p<0.05 to p<0.0001 across outcomes).",
